Rafkill: controls
=================

From the game's own README (the menus let you change them; they are kept
in the drawer's User drawer, User/rafkill.config):

  Up        cursor up, keypad 8 or W
  Down      cursor down, keypad 2, X or S
  Left      cursor left, keypad 4 or A
  Right     cursor right, keypad 6 or D
  Shoot     Space, Return or keypad Enter
  Switch the accessory weapon   Alt

Score buys weapons and hull parts between levels.
